001293  81D6  0FA4  8973                              MOVE HANDLE_FILE2, R9            ; ..somewhere in the middle
001294  81D8  0FA8  898C                              MOVE F_FRAG3, R10
001295  81DA  BB2C                                    XOR R11, R11
