001485                    ; ---- write a block through the fast path from BUF_A. The virtual drive
001486                    ; buffer is not emulated, so the bytes are staged in the SD controller
001487                    ; buffer and SDB_VD_WRBLK is told to write exactly that block: this
001488                    ; exercises the mapping, the flush/invalidate and the SD write, but not
001489                    ; the vdrives.vhd register protocol (only hardware can show that).
001490                    ; R9/R10: block index lo/hi; Carry=1 on success
